# Fernleaf Kitchen Frontend Configuration
#
# When deployed on Vercel as multiple services (or running via `vercel dev`):
# API requests route automatically via top-level /api rewrite and BACKEND_URL binding.
# Leave NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL unset/empty in that environment.
#
# For standalone local development (running frontend and backend independently without Vercel CLI):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000/api
